WEBVTT

01:37.530 --> 01:42.900
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.640 --> 01:45.890
[Episode 12]

01:46.430 --> 01:48.000
I apologize to everyone.

01:49.000 --> 01:50.600
I won't disturb you anymore.

01:52.840 --> 01:53.560
Qingyuan!

01:54.430 --> 01:56.000
Chunzhi, listen to me.

01:56.000 --> 01:57.509
I've heard enough from you!

01:57.509 --> 01:58.310
Chunzhi!

01:58.310 --> 01:59.560
You give her your whole heart,

01:59.560 --> 02:01.000
but you don't even know
she's leading you on

02:01.000 --> 02:03.000
while fooling around with Yan Rui
behind your back!

02:03.000 --> 02:04.070
Stop making a scene.

02:04.070 --> 02:05.000
I'm not!

02:06.950 --> 02:08.080
Chunzhi,

02:08.630 --> 02:09.520
do you know

02:09.810 --> 02:12.610
Grandmother has already
betrothed her to Yan Rui?

02:14.150 --> 02:15.360
Utter nonsense!

02:15.360 --> 02:16.640
This is unseemly!

02:24.800 --> 02:25.800
Mother...

02:27.360 --> 02:28.000
Qingyuan!

02:29.840 --> 02:30.440
Qingyuan.

02:34.520 --> 02:35.630
What Qingru just said,

02:35.630 --> 02:36.890
don't take it to heart.

02:36.910 --> 02:37.960
She's always been

02:37.960 --> 02:39.020
spoiled like that.

02:39.960 --> 02:41.270
I'll find a time to have a serious

02:41.270 --> 02:42.070
word with her.

02:43.800 --> 02:45.000
You saw the spectacle

02:45.470 --> 02:47.170
that unfolded just now.

02:47.470 --> 02:49.800
I'm seen as the black sheep
of the Xie family.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.930
If you're looking to get married,

02:52.030 --> 02:54.030
you should choose someone fitting.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.160
I don't care what others say.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.460
My previous rash proposal

02:59.800 --> 03:01.400
was forced by the situation.

03:02.030 --> 03:03.640
But instead of evading it,

03:04.080 --> 03:05.810
you treated me with sincerity.

03:06.190 --> 03:07.150
That made me

03:07.470 --> 03:08.730
respect you even more.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.000
You're really

03:15.430 --> 03:16.960
good at comforting people.

03:17.070 --> 03:18.329
I feel much better now.

03:23.400 --> 03:24.430
I just wonder

03:25.030 --> 03:26.800
which lucky gentleman will

03:27.150 --> 03:28.190
get to marry you.

03:33.630 --> 03:35.230
There are things I have to do.

03:35.750 --> 03:37.240
When I'm done with them,

03:38.030 --> 03:39.630
I'll leave marriage to fate.

03:41.840 --> 03:42.870
Does that mean...

03:44.400 --> 03:46.530
there's no one in your heart right now?

03:48.630 --> 03:50.030
I'm not looking for love.

03:51.750 --> 03:52.950
But there's one thing

03:53.190 --> 03:54.470
I need your help with.

03:57.150 --> 03:58.079
Sure. What is it?

03:59.360 --> 04:00.760
I want to see the marquis.

04:01.030 --> 04:01.710
My father?

04:03.240 --> 04:05.040
I know he rarely sees outsiders,

04:05.360 --> 04:06.890
but I have an urgent matter.

04:07.630 --> 04:09.910
I can't tell you why right now,

04:10.000 --> 04:12.530
but I promise
I'll explain everything later.

04:16.870 --> 04:17.510
Okay.

04:18.390 --> 04:19.589
I will make it happen.

04:21.040 --> 04:21.870
Thank you.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.920
Are you out of your mind?

04:29.000 --> 04:30.260
You must be possessed,

04:30.390 --> 04:32.270
acting crazy in front of
the marquis's son!

04:32.270 --> 04:33.800
Is this how I raised you?

04:35.390 --> 04:36.430
Qingyuan has

04:37.000 --> 04:39.170
long belonged to Yan Rui,

04:39.830 --> 04:41.590
yet she still goes out of her way

04:41.610 --> 04:43.670
to seduce my Chunzhi.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.420
I was worried Chunzhi would be fooled.

04:47.450 --> 04:49.350
That's why I told him.

04:50.430 --> 04:52.890
She's the one
who did those shameful things.

04:52.920 --> 04:53.720
Mother,

04:54.070 --> 04:56.080
why are you scolding me?

04:56.190 --> 04:57.450
How dare you talk back!

04:57.830 --> 04:58.680
Mother,

04:59.480 --> 05:01.160
stop scolding Second Sister.

05:01.480 --> 05:03.040
She didn't do anything wrong.

05:03.040 --> 05:03.920
Shut up.

05:06.480 --> 05:07.310
If I don't

05:07.800 --> 05:09.600
discipline you properly today,

05:09.630 --> 05:10.270
who knows

05:10.480 --> 05:12.920
what kind of trouble
you might cause down the line?

05:12.920 --> 05:13.750
Nanny Liu.

05:14.510 --> 05:15.370
Punish her with

05:15.430 --> 05:16.630
20 lashes of the cane!

05:16.630 --> 05:17.310
Mother!

05:17.310 --> 05:17.920
Yes.

05:20.950 --> 05:21.830
Hit her!

05:22.510 --> 05:23.750
Go on!

05:24.040 --> 05:26.160
Mother, just beat me to death!

05:26.510 --> 05:27.800
Hit me!

05:48.120 --> 05:49.390
These can go on the shelves.

05:49.390 --> 05:49.870
Okay.

06:04.920 --> 06:07.050
It's rare to see you so lost in thought.

06:07.120 --> 06:08.800
Are you thinking of

06:09.070 --> 06:10.600
Young Master Li or Lord Yan?

06:11.830 --> 06:13.580
Of course I'm thinking of...

06:15.390 --> 06:16.520
you, Eldest Sister.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.480
Do you think marriage is

06:20.510 --> 06:21.660
some kind of joke?

06:22.560 --> 06:25.200
Right now, be it
Young Master Li or Lord Yan,

06:25.240 --> 06:26.640
you have to make a choice.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.480
Young Master Li
comes from a prominent family

06:29.480 --> 06:30.810
and has a pure heart.

06:30.950 --> 06:32.610
He won't marry anyone but you.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.400
What's holding you back?

06:36.360 --> 06:38.490
He and I are on different paths.

06:39.630 --> 06:41.070
What about Lord Yan?

06:41.120 --> 06:42.450
Are you on the same path?

06:44.360 --> 06:45.930
Yan Rui is an old fox.

06:46.120 --> 06:47.720
I can't figure him out at all.

06:49.310 --> 06:51.450
You got involved with Lord Yan

06:51.720 --> 06:53.730
because of that estate incident.

06:53.750 --> 06:55.280
Grandmother had no choice.

06:55.390 --> 06:56.740
Now that Father's back,

06:56.870 --> 06:59.130
you should pull out to protect yourself.

06:59.310 --> 07:00.560
He's been driving up grain prices

07:00.560 --> 07:02.720
and swindling army provisions
throughout Hengtang.

07:02.720 --> 07:04.920
He'll run into trouble sooner or later.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.470
I'll get back to work.

07:14.270 --> 07:15.480
The porridge is so watery.

07:15.480 --> 07:16.510
How can we eat it?

07:16.680 --> 07:17.950
You pervert the law!

07:18.160 --> 07:19.220
Corrupt official!

07:20.070 --> 07:21.680
How dare you, you unruly pleb!

07:21.680 --> 07:22.510
Arrest him!

07:23.390 --> 07:24.240
What are you doing?

07:24.240 --> 07:24.870
Let me go!

07:25.360 --> 07:26.190
Corrupt official!

07:26.190 --> 07:26.950
Let me go!

07:27.360 --> 07:28.420
Corrupt official!

07:28.630 --> 07:30.230
Please don't be mad, My Lord.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.510
Let me go!

07:34.190 --> 07:34.920
My Lord,

07:35.740 --> 07:37.200
to be honest,

07:37.750 --> 07:39.150
these displaced victims

07:39.240 --> 07:42.450
survive on this little relief grain
day after day.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.720
They're at their breaking point.

07:44.720 --> 07:47.830
The county office is also
running out of grain.

07:50.750 --> 07:52.720
I didn't expect there to be
so many disaster victims.

07:52.720 --> 07:53.450
Yes, indeed.

07:54.240 --> 07:56.300
No doubt, the grain is insufficient.

07:56.680 --> 07:58.010
We need to collect more.

07:59.270 --> 07:59.870
My Lord,

08:00.480 --> 08:02.150
if we collect more,

08:02.430 --> 08:04.920
the grain price will likely go up again.

08:05.480 --> 08:07.190
It's even better if it goes up.

08:07.870 --> 08:10.240
Hengtang's been hit so hard
by this disaster;

08:10.240 --> 08:11.950
the relief grain is nowhere near enough.

08:11.950 --> 08:13.630
We'll have to collect sooner or later.

08:13.630 --> 08:15.270
Think about it, Lord Wei.

08:15.420 --> 08:17.610
As long as we have the grain,

08:18.040 --> 08:19.360
the higher the price,

08:19.750 --> 08:22.350
the higher we can sell it
to the imperial court.

08:22.750 --> 08:24.240
Both inside and out,

08:25.240 --> 08:27.300
there's a lot of money to be made here.

08:30.920 --> 08:33.120
You're absolutely right, My Lord.

08:33.870 --> 08:35.990
But there is one thing I don't get.

08:36.960 --> 08:39.830
Where should we get the money
for collecting grain?

08:39.870 --> 08:41.000
The imperial court.

08:41.390 --> 08:44.030
The relief silver allocated by the court
is on the way.

08:44.030 --> 08:45.870
When the time comes,
we'll split the grain

08:45.870 --> 08:47.200
and the money equally.

08:47.480 --> 08:48.880
The grain is in our hands,

08:49.150 --> 08:51.840
and so is the money.

08:59.830 --> 09:01.870
Please forgive my slow brain.

09:02.120 --> 09:04.750
That's why you've been checking
the army provisions everywhere

09:04.750 --> 09:06.930
since you arrived in Hengtang.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.280
Your Lordship

09:08.550 --> 09:10.440
is truly a brilliant strategist

09:10.440 --> 09:12.270
with great foresight.

09:12.630 --> 09:14.200
So, Lord Wei,

09:14.670 --> 09:16.550
please pay extra attention

09:16.910 --> 09:18.440
to the relief grain.

09:18.600 --> 09:20.200
It's an honor to share your burdens.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.600
I'd gladly lay down my life
for you, My Lord!

09:22.910 --> 09:23.720
Good.

09:24.790 --> 09:25.390
By the way,

09:26.200 --> 09:28.400
I've decided that the grain collection

09:29.000 --> 09:30.930
will be on the eighth of next month.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.080
Noted.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.210
Take care, My Lord.

09:53.960 --> 09:56.030
That's a risky move you're making.

10:01.120 --> 10:02.720
Holding out
until the supplies come is easy.

10:02.720 --> 10:04.270
The hard part is keeping control

10:04.270 --> 10:07.000
and dealing with
their inevitable retaliation.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.270
It is risky.

10:09.360 --> 10:12.260
So we must have enough troops

10:12.390 --> 10:14.320
to ensure that nothing goes wrong.

10:16.240 --> 10:17.900
Where will you get the troops?

10:26.480 --> 10:27.960
You mean,

10:28.670 --> 10:30.330
after the case was concluded,

10:30.910 --> 10:33.240
Yan Rui hasn't made any moves?

10:34.200 --> 10:35.460
That's right, My Lord.

10:35.670 --> 10:36.800
Please have a look at

10:38.000 --> 10:40.750
this bowl of Purple Bamboo Shoot Tea
I've whisked.

10:40.750 --> 10:43.150
Isn't it vibrant and aromatic?

10:45.960 --> 10:48.630
No wonder the Tea Sage, Lu Yu, called it

10:48.630 --> 10:50.160
the crown jewel of all teas.

10:52.720 --> 10:53.980
Please enjoy, My Lord.

10:58.030 --> 10:59.430
It's only been a few days,

10:59.510 --> 11:02.790
and you've suddenly become so cultured.

11:04.790 --> 11:07.360
Well, your sudden visit

11:07.910 --> 11:11.000
couldn't be just to
whisk a bowl of tea for me.

11:11.870 --> 11:13.330
You're mistaken, My Lord.

11:13.870 --> 11:15.870
In just a few days since you got back,

11:16.480 --> 11:18.870
you've made Yan Rui
move out of the Xie Residence

11:18.870 --> 11:20.670
and drop the grain swap investigation.

11:20.670 --> 11:23.180
What absolute genius

11:23.200 --> 11:24.730
and incredible foresight.

11:25.870 --> 11:27.910
This bowl isn't just tea.

11:28.120 --> 11:30.030
It is a show of my

11:30.030 --> 11:32.270
admiration and respect for you.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.670
Elegance cannot be learned.

11:39.000 --> 11:42.270
Do you know this tea has another name

11:43.030 --> 11:44.720
called Jicheng?

11:47.630 --> 11:49.000
"Ji" as in "urgent,"

11:49.870 --> 11:51.440
and "cheng" as in "journey."

11:51.440 --> 11:52.670
It means

11:53.600 --> 11:55.440
this tea is very urgent.

11:58.960 --> 12:01.160
Since the tea leaves leave the tea tree,

12:01.720 --> 12:03.720
every extra moment of delay

12:03.910 --> 12:06.270
reduces its freshness.

12:06.840 --> 12:10.000
So, while you appear to be
elegantly whisking the tea

12:10.000 --> 12:12.320
at your own pace,

12:14.150 --> 12:16.240
you are, in fact, ruining it.

12:24.480 --> 12:25.440
You seem to be

12:26.000 --> 12:27.200
implying something.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.160
I'm dull-witted.

12:29.390 --> 12:31.080
Please speak plainly.

12:32.030 --> 12:32.960
I wouldn't dare.

12:33.320 --> 12:34.600
I just think

12:34.910 --> 12:36.600
things are

12:37.150 --> 12:38.150
in reverse.

12:38.630 --> 12:40.510
All thanks to your care,

12:40.870 --> 12:44.390
my son survived this disaster.

12:44.840 --> 12:47.150
I should be the one toasting you

12:47.600 --> 12:49.120
with this bowl of tea.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.030
My dear lord,

12:56.750 --> 12:58.510
everything I've done was

12:59.080 --> 13:02.280
purely for the agenda
of the person who pulls the strings.

13:02.670 --> 13:04.200
Second Young Master aside,

13:04.510 --> 13:07.150
you and I are like fish in this water.

13:07.600 --> 13:08.840
If one fish suffers,

13:09.360 --> 13:11.000
the whole school perishes.

13:23.750 --> 13:26.210
It's not enough that
you ruined the good tea.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.960
Now you're harming my fish.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.400
Let's get down to business.

13:34.840 --> 13:36.100
The grain swap matter,

13:36.670 --> 13:38.000
I've settled it for you.

13:44.240 --> 13:46.480
But Yan Rui is too unpredictable

13:44.320 --> 13:45.070
[Ledger]
[1st Month of the 8th Year of Jingxi]

13:45.090 --> 13:46.630
[Ledger] [20 grain-transport boats;
3,000 dan collected]

13:46.480 --> 13:47.670
a person.

13:47.910 --> 13:49.910
If he stirs up trouble again,

13:50.120 --> 13:52.380
you'd better hold onto your sedan chair.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.870
I can't help with everything.

13:55.710 --> 13:56.040
[7 water ships borrowed from the Xies,
not officially registered]

13:57.080 --> 13:58.600
Have you forgotten?

14:00.600 --> 14:03.480
Who granted me this sedan chair,

14:04.360 --> 14:06.390
and who is carrying it for me?

14:12.480 --> 14:13.670
Ultimately,

14:14.870 --> 14:17.510
Yan Rui is still after fame and fortune.

14:17.910 --> 14:19.840
He wants to use disaster relief
as an excuse

14:19.840 --> 14:20.910
to earn political merit

14:20.910 --> 14:22.310
and then make a windfall.

14:22.910 --> 14:23.960
In that case,

14:24.320 --> 14:26.320
we should play along

14:26.480 --> 14:28.140
and help him secure the grain.

14:29.080 --> 14:31.340
Once the money and grain are in our hands,

14:31.960 --> 14:33.960
we can eliminate him
without getting

14:33.960 --> 14:35.080
our hands dirty.

14:37.120 --> 14:40.120
Then we'll submit a petition
to His Majesty against him,

14:40.120 --> 14:41.660
pushing all the blame

14:41.840 --> 14:43.360
onto him alone.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.630
By then,

14:48.120 --> 14:48.960
My Lord,

14:49.720 --> 14:50.480
you and I will

14:51.150 --> 14:52.390
both be worry-free.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.150
Where'd we get so much grain?

14:58.550 --> 15:00.000
Looks like

15:01.600 --> 15:04.360
we'll have to put on a good show.

15:14.790 --> 15:15.600
Yum!

15:16.630 --> 15:17.560
It's delicious.

15:18.320 --> 15:19.720
This plum blossom pastry

15:19.910 --> 15:22.570
not only nourishes the skin
and enhances beauty

15:22.670 --> 15:25.070
but also really smells like plum blossoms.

15:25.670 --> 15:28.790
This four-herb lotus seed cake
is also quite exquisite.

15:28.790 --> 15:30.390
Its subtle, pleasant sweetness perfectly

15:30.390 --> 15:31.910
complements its therapeutic benefits of

15:31.910 --> 15:33.600
soothing the mind,
strengthening the spleen,

15:33.600 --> 15:34.600
and dispelling body dampness.

15:34.600 --> 15:35.480
Have a taste.

15:36.000 --> 15:36.440
Sure.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.320
I hope our herbal snacks

15:38.320 --> 15:39.720
will be crowd-pleasers,

15:39.870 --> 15:41.910
so our efforts won't be in vain.

15:42.670 --> 15:44.080
Don't worry, Qingyuan.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.750
Such tasty snacks will

15:45.910 --> 15:47.170
definitely sell well.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.960
They're so good.

15:51.360 --> 15:53.160
Good thing we're opening a shop.

15:53.510 --> 15:54.170
Otherwise,

15:54.390 --> 15:56.440
I'd polish off everything.

16:00.550 --> 16:02.010
-Have some more.
-My Lady.

16:02.030 --> 16:03.440
A guest outside

16:03.440 --> 16:04.840
wants to see you.

16:20.790 --> 16:21.870
Army Inspector of the Northern Frontier,

16:21.870 --> 16:23.440
I, the fourth daughter
of the Hengtang Xie family,

16:23.440 --> 16:24.870
pay my respects to Your Lordship.

16:24.870 --> 16:27.150
So you are the Fourth Lady,

16:27.150 --> 16:28.320
Xie Qingyuan.

16:29.750 --> 16:31.440
Since you know my name,

16:31.440 --> 16:33.700
you must be no stranger to the Xie family.

16:34.270 --> 16:36.360
Grandmother gave us this shop

16:36.360 --> 16:37.480
to practice with.

16:37.670 --> 16:39.080
I stayed a bit late today.

16:39.390 --> 16:40.480
Since we're fated to meet,

16:40.480 --> 16:41.320
why don't you

16:41.320 --> 16:43.030
come in and try our snacks?

16:43.720 --> 16:46.200
My son insists on marrying you.

16:46.480 --> 16:47.790
So I came

16:47.960 --> 16:50.080
specially to see

16:50.200 --> 16:52.840
what kind of woman you are.

16:55.320 --> 16:57.480
You're easy on the eyes,

16:57.840 --> 17:01.120
but not particularly special.

17:01.960 --> 17:03.000
I'm curious.

17:03.480 --> 17:06.640
You're a lady of noble birth,

17:07.510 --> 17:09.880
yet you show your face in the streets

17:10.680 --> 17:12.349
and engage in petty commerce.

17:12.750 --> 17:14.069
What kind of spell

17:14.550 --> 17:16.960
did you put on my son?

17:18.880 --> 17:19.589
My Lord,

17:19.720 --> 17:21.579
if you're visiting our snack shop

17:21.680 --> 17:24.200
for tea and snacks,

17:24.200 --> 17:25.920
please deign to step out of your sedan

17:25.920 --> 17:27.109
and come in to taste them.

17:27.109 --> 17:28.590
We will host you well.

17:28.920 --> 17:31.350
If you're only here to act superior

17:31.400 --> 17:33.680
and heap scorn and insult on me,

17:34.000 --> 17:35.070
then I'm sorry,

17:35.350 --> 17:36.400
but our measly shop

17:36.400 --> 17:37.600
is too insignificant

17:37.720 --> 17:39.920
to host a distinguished guest like you.

17:41.350 --> 17:43.000
Sharp-tongued

17:44.510 --> 17:46.160
philistine.

17:47.110 --> 17:48.910
A marriage between you and my son

17:49.160 --> 17:50.760
is absolutely blasphemous.

17:52.440 --> 17:53.370
Let's head home.

17:55.590 --> 17:56.650
Take care, My Lord.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.550
Qingyuan,

18:11.510 --> 18:13.310
that was the Marquis of Danyang.

18:13.550 --> 18:15.270
He wields massive military power

18:15.270 --> 18:16.830
and has a twisted personality.

18:16.830 --> 18:18.090
Why'd you provoke him?

18:19.440 --> 18:21.370
I can't worry about that right now.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.960
I need you to do me a favor.

18:27.680 --> 18:28.680
Let's eat.

18:33.350 --> 18:34.200
Congxin.

18:35.440 --> 18:36.350
Congxin!

18:42.200 --> 18:43.510
Alright. Come on.

18:43.830 --> 18:45.550
There are tons of great ladies around.

18:45.550 --> 18:47.350
Why fixate on one woman?

18:47.590 --> 18:49.030
Isn't Qingru a catch too?

18:52.590 --> 18:53.680
And you.

18:54.270 --> 18:55.790
How could you be so mean

18:56.110 --> 18:57.680
to the woman our son likes?

18:58.000 --> 18:58.720
My Lady—

18:58.720 --> 19:01.050
Your fuse is getting shorter and shorter.

19:01.350 --> 19:02.000
My Lady!

19:02.830 --> 19:04.000
When you came begging my family

19:04.000 --> 19:06.000
for my hand in marriage
when you were younger,

19:06.000 --> 19:07.530
weren't you just like this?

19:07.920 --> 19:09.960
Is it really that difficult to

19:10.110 --> 19:11.910
put yourself in our boy's shoes?

19:12.070 --> 19:14.000
-My Lady.
-Be more understanding.

19:19.590 --> 19:20.750
No matter what,

19:21.270 --> 19:22.440
that woman cannot

19:22.720 --> 19:24.960
cross the threshold of our household.

19:28.070 --> 19:29.000
I'm done eating.

19:34.960 --> 19:35.750
I'm full too.

19:36.310 --> 19:38.370
You father and son are unbelievable!

19:38.590 --> 19:40.310
One is more stubborn than the other!

19:40.310 --> 19:41.440
I'm done eating too!

19:42.110 --> 19:43.110
Who needs a family

19:43.790 --> 19:44.790
like this anyway!

19:46.550 --> 19:47.310
My Lord.

19:47.510 --> 19:48.160
Young Master.

19:48.160 --> 19:48.590
Madam.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.590
Miss Qingyuan had someone

19:50.590 --> 19:52.190
bring a box of herbal snacks.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.790
How exquisite.

20:04.160 --> 20:05.480
She's so thoughtful.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.090
It's delicious.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.400
My Lord,

20:16.880 --> 20:18.340
they're really well made.

20:18.830 --> 20:19.750
Count me out.

20:21.070 --> 20:21.750
Come here.

20:28.830 --> 20:30.000
Come on. Try it.

20:32.070 --> 20:32.600
It's hot.

20:34.000 --> 20:34.920
Delicious, right?

20:34.920 --> 20:36.240
Mm, yes. Delicious.

20:38.550 --> 20:39.400
I knew

20:40.030 --> 20:41.830
you must still be thinking of me.

20:43.240 --> 20:44.070
How about

20:44.720 --> 20:45.960
the two of you

20:46.720 --> 20:48.120
meet each other halfway?

20:49.920 --> 20:50.680
My Lady,

20:50.750 --> 20:52.070
I'm fine.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.070
That's better.

20:58.640 --> 20:59.480
Don't just look at it.

20:59.480 --> 21:00.350
Eat up.

21:01.160 --> 21:02.090
It's delicious.

21:02.920 --> 21:03.920
By the way, Madam,

21:04.030 --> 21:05.360
Miss Qingyuan also said

21:05.480 --> 21:07.990
these snacks are an apology
to the marquis.

21:08.240 --> 21:09.590
What a sweet girl.

21:27.000 --> 21:27.800
Grandmother.

21:29.790 --> 21:31.070
Let me have a taste.

21:34.830 --> 21:35.750
Mother.

21:39.640 --> 21:41.110
So pretty.

21:47.070 --> 21:48.070
Really good.

21:52.030 --> 21:53.000
Delicious.

21:53.920 --> 21:55.180
Sweet but not cloying,

21:55.240 --> 21:56.310
soft and tasty,

21:56.750 --> 21:58.410
and even good for your health.

21:59.880 --> 22:01.400
Qingyuan's shop will

22:01.400 --> 22:02.590
surely be a success.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.200
Opening this shop

22:08.550 --> 22:09.790
is a good thing,

22:10.510 --> 22:13.750
but Qingyuan is not yet married.

22:14.030 --> 22:15.920
Doing everything herself

22:16.070 --> 22:17.270
must be exhausting.

22:17.830 --> 22:19.760
Constantly being in the public eye

22:20.790 --> 22:22.590
will inevitably invite gossip.

22:29.350 --> 22:32.270
Why not get someone in the residence

22:32.270 --> 22:33.510
to manage it for you

22:33.640 --> 22:34.920
and share your burden?

22:44.310 --> 22:46.710
It wasn't easy for Qingyuan
to get this shop

22:47.000 --> 22:48.370
up and running.

22:48.440 --> 22:50.790
Of course it wasn't easy.

22:53.640 --> 22:56.370
Regardless, it's still
inappropriate for a lady

22:56.750 --> 22:58.240
to always show her face

22:58.790 --> 22:59.790
in public.

23:01.440 --> 23:03.960
What is more crucial for a lady

23:05.000 --> 23:07.270
than a blessed and smooth marriage?

23:16.790 --> 23:17.830
Alright.

23:18.350 --> 23:19.440
The girl is grown up

23:20.200 --> 23:21.680
and has her own ideas.

23:23.880 --> 23:26.240
Let her do what she wants to do.

23:28.880 --> 23:31.210
It's not as if
a lady from the Xie family...

23:32.790 --> 23:34.920
would ever struggle to find a husband.

23:40.480 --> 23:41.750
Mother,

23:42.110 --> 23:44.110
you're spoiling Qingyuan too much.

23:44.750 --> 23:47.680
I actually think our household

23:48.070 --> 23:50.550
is doing much better than before.

23:51.400 --> 23:52.730
In terms of management,

23:53.440 --> 23:57.400
you should learn from Mei Yinghua.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.920
You're right, Mother.

24:10.920 --> 24:12.270
I have a lot to learn.

24:12.440 --> 24:15.190
I'll look to seek advice
from Concubine Mei.

24:20.110 --> 24:21.160
But Mother,

24:22.350 --> 24:24.030
because of Zhengjun's matter,

24:24.030 --> 24:25.630
the Xie family was besieged,

24:25.640 --> 24:27.070
causing quite a stir outside.

24:27.070 --> 24:29.000
Although the incident has passed,

24:29.030 --> 24:29.920
I can't help...

24:31.440 --> 24:33.200
but feel sorry for Eldest Lady.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.000
Not one person from

24:37.680 --> 24:40.540
the Founding Count's household
has shown up since.

24:40.680 --> 24:42.350
It wouldn't look good

24:43.310 --> 24:45.550
if word got out that she is

24:46.240 --> 24:47.370
working in the shop.

24:49.920 --> 24:52.680
The Founding Count's household
values Eldest Sister.

24:52.680 --> 24:53.960
Preparing for

24:54.350 --> 24:55.880
a perfect wedding

24:55.880 --> 24:57.510
naturally takes time.

25:02.270 --> 25:04.670
Fret not about my little shop,
First Madam.

25:05.240 --> 25:06.830
You're busy as it is,

25:07.030 --> 25:09.090
what with all the household affairs.

25:10.270 --> 25:11.000
Sure.

25:11.790 --> 25:13.850
As long as you know what you're doing.

25:14.720 --> 25:16.270
I trust that you will

25:16.270 --> 25:17.670
evaluate the priorities

25:17.720 --> 25:19.180
and make mindful choices.

25:21.440 --> 25:23.100
Your shop is a small matter...

25:25.920 --> 25:27.850
but your eldest sister's marriage

25:28.200 --> 25:29.510
is a big deal.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.310
Enough talk.

25:39.590 --> 25:43.510
Let's all taste what Qingyuan made.

25:47.110 --> 25:48.070
Qingyuan,

25:50.510 --> 25:52.040
since you've decided on it,

25:52.880 --> 25:54.240
commit and do it well.

25:56.960 --> 25:58.000
I understand.

26:12.550 --> 26:14.480
Dear locals and distinguished guests,

26:12.960 --> 26:14.480
[Yunji Snacks]

26:14.680 --> 26:16.510
our Yunji Snacks

26:16.510 --> 26:18.350
is officially open!

26:19.640 --> 26:21.350
Our original snacks are

26:21.440 --> 26:22.640
uniquely handcrafted

26:22.640 --> 26:25.400
by combining
traditional Chinese herbal formulas

26:23.610 --> 26:26.500
[Cherokee Rosehip & Jade Dew Ball]
[Coix Seed & Poria Cake]

26:25.400 --> 26:26.960
with various culinary techniques.

26:26.960 --> 26:29.180
With 36 distinct herbal snacks,

26:29.400 --> 26:31.660
there's surely something for everyone.

26:31.790 --> 26:32.400
Next,

26:32.400 --> 26:35.350
please follow me into the shop
to make your pick.

26:35.960 --> 26:37.020
So many kinds!

26:43.270 --> 26:45.270
I didn't expect our herbal snacks

26:45.270 --> 26:46.510
to be so popular.

26:48.640 --> 26:51.110
It's a pity that we're both unmarried

26:51.550 --> 26:53.880
and have to miss out on the fun.

26:54.960 --> 26:56.830
What kind of pointless rule is that?

26:56.830 --> 26:57.880
If you want to go,

26:57.880 --> 26:59.070
I'll go with you.

27:05.790 --> 27:07.070
Madam Pei has arrived!

27:19.920 --> 27:22.110
Contrary to Concubine Lian's worries

27:22.350 --> 27:24.480
that Madam Pei would
waver about your marriage

27:24.480 --> 27:26.000
because Xie Residence was besieged,

27:26.000 --> 27:28.000
Madam Pei has come here in person.

27:28.590 --> 27:30.320
But why are you hiding instead?

27:31.720 --> 27:33.110
I'm not ready yet.

27:33.750 --> 27:34.920
Are you afraid that Madam Pei

27:34.920 --> 27:36.920
is here to break off the engagement?

27:38.550 --> 27:40.130
I doubt that's the case.

27:40.440 --> 27:41.790
To break off the engagement,

27:41.790 --> 27:43.240
a letter would be enough.

27:43.790 --> 27:45.790
Madam Pei coming here in person

27:46.110 --> 27:48.910
means that things have
taken a turn for the better.

27:53.240 --> 27:54.790
Don't be scared.

27:55.110 --> 27:56.040
I'll go with you.

27:58.640 --> 28:00.880
How ingenious of
the women of the Xie family

28:00.880 --> 28:02.940
to come up with such a brilliant idea.

28:02.960 --> 28:03.790
Madam Pei.

28:09.400 --> 28:09.930
Let's go.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.890
The business is booming, huh?

28:14.030 --> 28:15.640
I almost couldn't spot you.

28:16.110 --> 28:17.370
Greetings, Madam Pei.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.550
Madam Pei,

28:20.070 --> 28:21.310
long time no see.

28:22.790 --> 28:23.590
Come,

28:24.000 --> 28:25.330
let me have a look at you.

28:26.480 --> 28:28.280
My wonderful daughter-in-law.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.920
It's been a while, and you've

28:30.920 --> 28:32.520
become even more beautiful.

28:34.920 --> 28:35.400
Come,

28:35.400 --> 28:36.440
shop with me.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.770
Let's pick some snacks.

28:39.880 --> 28:41.880
We're going to be family soon.

28:41.880 --> 28:43.510
Don't be so formal around me.

28:44.640 --> 28:46.220
Got it, Madam Pei.

28:46.270 --> 28:47.070
You know what?

28:49.000 --> 28:50.730
Your business sure is booming.

28:52.160 --> 28:53.270
Why are you here?

28:53.590 --> 28:54.960
It's your opening day.

28:54.960 --> 28:57.020
How could I not come and show support?

28:58.160 --> 28:59.240
Is my tiny shop

28:59.240 --> 29:01.240
befitting of your attention?

29:01.590 --> 29:03.110
With your financial power,

29:03.110 --> 29:05.040
you could buy out my shop in a flash.

29:08.160 --> 29:10.590
You're getting sweeter and sweeter
with your words.

29:10.590 --> 29:12.640
I wonder if Young Master Li knows.

29:14.920 --> 29:17.240
If you want to ask about the progress

29:17.240 --> 29:18.500
of the task you gave me,

29:18.830 --> 29:20.030
just get to the point.

29:20.480 --> 29:21.830
Why beat around the bush?

29:21.830 --> 29:22.440
I see.

29:22.960 --> 29:24.350
Judging from your reaction,

29:24.350 --> 29:26.810
I take it the task
hasn't been completed yet.

29:26.920 --> 29:27.440
What,

29:28.400 --> 29:29.830
are you going to make me

29:30.160 --> 29:32.760
wait until you and Young Master Li
have a child?

29:35.750 --> 29:36.550
Qingyuan!

29:38.790 --> 29:39.510
Qingyuan.

29:39.880 --> 29:40.480
Qingyuan!

29:45.110 --> 29:45.710
Qingyuan.

29:47.480 --> 29:48.410
Young Master Li.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.480
Chunzhi heard that you opened today.

29:52.480 --> 29:53.740
He insisted on coming,

29:53.790 --> 29:56.310
saying that not even the end of times
could stop him.

29:56.310 --> 29:56.960
Qingyuan,

29:57.790 --> 29:59.200
I'm here to deliver an invitation.

29:59.200 --> 30:02.130
My parents would like to
invite you to watch an opera.

30:04.190 --> 30:05.830
[From the Marquis of Danyang family]

30:06.480 --> 30:07.310
The marquis?

30:08.640 --> 30:10.640
The marquis rarely sees outsiders.

30:11.030 --> 30:13.560
Today he's actually
inviting you to an opera.

30:15.240 --> 30:17.880
Do I hear some wedding bells ringing?

30:19.960 --> 30:21.890
Lord Yan, a lot of free time lately?

30:22.160 --> 30:23.290
You are everywhere.

30:23.550 --> 30:24.270
Of course.

30:24.510 --> 30:25.480
Good thing I'm here,

30:25.480 --> 30:27.270
or I'd have missed out on
this joyous event.

30:27.270 --> 30:28.480
You aren't invited to the opera.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.540
That's not joyous.

30:29.920 --> 30:30.750
However,

30:31.160 --> 30:33.090
when Fourth Lady and I get married,

30:34.200 --> 30:35.550
I can invite you for a drink

30:35.550 --> 30:37.680
and share some of my good luck with you.

30:38.640 --> 30:39.960
Is the banquet already booked?

30:39.960 --> 30:41.020
Why aren't I aware?

30:42.720 --> 30:44.520
Fourth Lady, are you aware of it?

30:47.920 --> 30:50.270
Lord Yan, you don't have to
worry about this.

30:50.270 --> 30:52.110
Fourth Lady's heart and my heart are

30:52.110 --> 30:53.170
perfectly in tune.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.640
Marriage is a major event

31:00.790 --> 31:02.250
decided by one's parents.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.640
Please stop putting my sister on the spot.

31:04.640 --> 31:05.200
Yes,

31:06.070 --> 31:07.200
that's right.

31:07.550 --> 31:09.160
It's not up to me anyway.

31:09.550 --> 31:10.950
Please, Your Lordships,

31:12.110 --> 31:13.550
enough teasing me.

31:13.790 --> 31:15.510
It's Yunji Snacks' opening day.

31:15.510 --> 31:16.920
Pick whatever

31:16.920 --> 31:18.010
you want.

31:18.110 --> 31:20.590
It's on me. How does that sound?

31:21.510 --> 31:22.200
Qingyuan,

31:22.750 --> 31:25.640
can you recommend some snacks for me?

31:33.160 --> 31:33.820
Have a seat.

31:34.750 --> 31:35.410
This is

31:35.510 --> 31:37.350
our notoginseng sticky rice cake.

31:37.350 --> 31:39.720
Notoginseng stops bleeding
and disperses blood stasis.

31:39.720 --> 31:42.720
Sticky rice flushes out toxins
and reduces swelling.

31:56.940 --> 32:03.780
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

32:03.810 --> 32:11.000
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

32:04.680 --> 32:06.510
Eldest Brother, you're upright,

32:06.510 --> 32:09.240
and Second Brother
did nothing wrong to get hurt.

32:09.310 --> 32:11.640
Since we're like-minded,
it only makes sense

32:11.100 --> 32:14.620
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

32:12.720 --> 32:13.920
to get closer.

32:14.650 --> 32:17.820
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

32:15.270 --> 32:16.470
Thank you, Qingyuan.

32:17.840 --> 32:24.980
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

32:19.350 --> 32:20.000
Chunzhi,

32:20.550 --> 32:21.110
let's go.

32:21.550 --> 32:22.880
We've bought the snacks

32:22.920 --> 32:24.070
and delivered the invitation.

32:24.070 --> 32:25.720
We shouldn't keep Mr. Lanshan waiting.

32:25.050 --> 32:32.420
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

32:26.790 --> 32:27.480
Qingyuan,

32:28.030 --> 32:29.690
see you at the southern opera.

32:32.440 --> 32:39.450
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

32:39.480 --> 32:40.510
As you saw,

32:39.480 --> 32:43.510
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

32:40.920 --> 32:43.510
I've gotten the invitation
from Marquis of Danyang.

32:43.510 --> 32:44.880
Which means I've completed

32:43.530 --> 32:44.940
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

32:45.000 --> 32:46.660
half of what you asked me to do.

32:47.640 --> 32:48.030
Yes,

32:48.920 --> 32:51.160
the task I entrusted to you is half done.

32:52.350 --> 32:54.070
But isn't your blessed big day

32:54.070 --> 32:55.310
halfway here as well?

32:56.070 --> 32:57.350
I'm blessed to be able

32:57.830 --> 32:59.400
to share your burden.

33:01.200 --> 33:03.370
The silly look on your face

33:03.920 --> 33:06.380
really resembles a harmless little rabbit.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.440
Unfortunately,

33:08.440 --> 33:10.640
someone is about to
bark up the wrong tree.

33:10.640 --> 33:12.680
What do you mean by that?

33:13.480 --> 33:14.960
I thought

33:15.350 --> 33:17.350
you were just good at taming horses.

33:17.920 --> 33:20.320
To think you're also
good at taming people.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.600
Even the most capable heroes
couldn't get an audience

33:22.600 --> 33:23.600
with the marquis,

33:23.720 --> 33:25.550
yet you received an invitation

33:25.550 --> 33:26.880
in just a few days.

33:27.440 --> 33:30.570
Don't you think the marquis's son
deserves huge credit?

33:32.270 --> 33:33.240
Strange.

33:34.920 --> 33:36.440
Why do you smell

33:37.240 --> 33:39.160
so sour today?

33:39.640 --> 33:40.790
Did someone

33:41.270 --> 33:42.800
spill vinegar all over you?

33:50.960 --> 33:52.070
I'm just happy.

33:53.350 --> 33:54.720
I'm happy that I, the fox,

33:54.720 --> 33:56.520
didn't capture a little rabbit,

33:56.640 --> 33:59.640
but a veritable immortal
with profound cultivation.

34:03.110 --> 34:04.590
It was just a joke.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.590
The way you reacted,

34:07.070 --> 34:09.230
you might just have
let your true feelings slip.

34:09.230 --> 34:10.400
Since I'm a weapon

34:10.670 --> 34:12.760
who is valuable to you,

34:13.360 --> 34:16.150
shouldn't you take good care of me?

34:16.760 --> 34:18.480
Otherwise, it'll be a pity.

34:30.820 --> 34:37.719
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

34:31.760 --> 34:33.290
Then you should be careful.

34:34.280 --> 34:36.139
Don't show your true form so soon.

34:37.739 --> 34:44.219
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

34:44.320 --> 34:51.960
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

34:46.880 --> 34:47.679
What's wrong?

34:49.510 --> 34:50.370
Are you scared?

34:52.080 --> 34:59.380
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

34:56.800 --> 34:58.000
As for what you asked,

34:58.400 --> 34:59.360
I'll get it done

34:59.520 --> 35:06.450
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

34:59.590 --> 35:00.710
within 3 days.

35:01.110 --> 35:03.110
Speaking of which, have you fulfilled

35:03.110 --> 35:04.070
my request?

35:05.070 --> 35:06.000
Where is Cui'er?

35:06.550 --> 35:16.360
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

35:07.760 --> 35:09.290
In your big shop, I wonder if

35:09.960 --> 35:12.070
you have my favorite perilla candy.

35:16.890 --> 35:24.090
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

35:19.760 --> 35:21.030
You can have

35:21.840 --> 35:22.900
whatever you like.

35:24.110 --> 35:31.280
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

35:26.960 --> 35:29.220
Hopefully it isn't poisonous this time.

35:29.840 --> 35:30.320
My Lord,

35:31.310 --> 35:34.890
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

35:31.710 --> 35:33.310
have you found Cui'er or not?

35:34.910 --> 35:38.530
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

35:35.000 --> 35:35.710
Alright.

35:36.280 --> 35:38.190
When you fulfill your end of the promise,

35:38.190 --> 35:40.030
I'll take you
to the person you want to see.

35:38.560 --> 35:44.670
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

35:41.070 --> 35:41.600
Goodbye.

35:44.670 --> 35:45.330
Delicious.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.670
Slow down on the snacks.

35:51.440 --> 35:54.440
Do you really think that girl
cares about your recovery?

35:54.440 --> 35:55.110
Mother,

35:55.440 --> 35:57.110
this is quite tasty.

35:57.590 --> 35:58.960
The main thing is that after eating it,

35:58.960 --> 36:00.560
my butt doesn't hurt as much.

36:03.570 --> 36:05.720
[Notoginseng Sticky Rice Cake]

36:09.440 --> 36:12.030
This is an opportunity.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.420
What opportunity?

36:14.630 --> 36:15.550
I could

36:15.960 --> 36:17.800
do First Madam a favor

36:18.280 --> 36:21.080
and have someone
look into Qingyuan's snack shop.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.360
I just don't believe

36:22.630 --> 36:24.280
that you can

36:24.840 --> 36:27.440
polish a turd.

36:35.110 --> 36:36.000
Old Madam.

36:36.880 --> 36:39.920
The Marquis of Danyang household
had a bit of a slip-up.

36:39.920 --> 36:42.150
The invitation meant for our family

36:42.590 --> 36:44.250
wasn't sent to our residence.

36:44.550 --> 36:46.630
Instead, it ended up in Qingyuan's hands.

36:46.630 --> 36:47.590
Fortunately,

36:47.710 --> 36:48.880
the nanny found out early,

36:48.880 --> 36:50.920
so I could get to the bottom of it.

36:51.150 --> 36:52.890
[From the Marquis of Danyang family,
respectfully presented to the Xie family]

36:57.710 --> 36:59.550
Marquis of Danyang's family

37:00.440 --> 37:02.000
never hosts guests.

37:04.230 --> 37:08.510
I don't know whether to celebrate or worry

37:09.230 --> 37:13.150
about this sudden invitation.

37:14.330 --> 37:15.490
[From the Marquis of Danyang family,
respectfully presented to the Xie family]

37:14.550 --> 37:15.480
Mother,

37:16.000 --> 37:18.840
the Marchioness of Danyang is the host,

37:19.440 --> 37:20.920
and their son will be present.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.440
They invited our family's children

37:22.440 --> 37:23.640
and the young ladies.

37:24.230 --> 37:27.400
The opera must be an excuse
to discuss marriage.

37:27.880 --> 37:29.540
It's a cause for celebration.

37:32.030 --> 37:33.670
At my age,

37:34.360 --> 37:35.440
do I need you

37:36.670 --> 37:38.710
to remind me about such things?

37:39.840 --> 37:40.510
Right.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.000
Qingyuan,

37:44.630 --> 37:45.920
tell me the truth.

37:47.150 --> 37:49.030
Do you have feelings for

37:49.550 --> 37:50.760
the marquis's son?

37:56.360 --> 37:57.110
Mother,

37:57.670 --> 38:00.760
I didn't grow up in a noble family,

38:01.110 --> 38:03.440
but I do know the importance of gratitude.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.960
I'm taken care of by you in this home.

38:06.230 --> 38:07.320
As your daughter,

38:07.320 --> 38:09.320
of course I want what's best for you.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.320
Therefore,

38:12.510 --> 38:14.280
I won't touch the man

38:14.630 --> 38:17.070
Second Sister is in love with.

38:17.440 --> 38:18.710
That is one reason.

38:19.230 --> 38:20.480
The second being...

38:24.800 --> 38:27.150
that I have someone else I love.

38:27.710 --> 38:29.000
So how could I

38:29.320 --> 38:31.670
have any feelings for the marquis's son?

38:32.480 --> 38:33.280
Child,

38:34.230 --> 38:37.760
who is the person you love?

38:37.840 --> 38:38.630
What's there

38:39.630 --> 38:40.830
to be confused about?

38:41.400 --> 38:43.030
Who else could it be?

38:45.440 --> 38:46.630
Qingyuan,

38:47.800 --> 38:48.880
do you really have

38:49.760 --> 38:52.800
zero feelings for the marquis's son?

38:58.280 --> 38:59.440
If so,

39:00.440 --> 39:02.150
you don't have to go to

39:02.510 --> 39:04.110
tomorrow's southern opera.

39:04.630 --> 39:05.670
Stay at home.

39:06.190 --> 39:08.510
You can help me massage my legs.

39:09.070 --> 39:12.880
Yes, Old Madam hasn't been feeling well.

39:13.070 --> 39:14.400
It'd be great if you stay

39:14.710 --> 39:16.670
and nurse her back to health.

39:19.000 --> 39:19.550
Yes,

39:20.190 --> 39:24.190
I'm willing to stay home
and serve you, Grandmother.

39:25.550 --> 39:26.400
Is that so?

39:26.400 --> 39:27.800
Then it's settled.

39:33.070 --> 39:36.190
Yan Rui is nothing
but a short-lived nuisance

39:37.480 --> 39:39.880
who won't last long.

39:40.710 --> 39:44.000
He's even made an enemy
of our Xie family.

39:44.400 --> 39:47.510
Are you really willing to give up

39:48.480 --> 39:50.150
the marquis's son for him?

39:52.760 --> 39:53.510
I...

39:56.070 --> 39:56.880
I...

39:58.360 --> 40:01.150
Even if the marquis's son is fond of me,

40:03.150 --> 40:05.750
how could I dare to
compete with Second Sister?

40:10.510 --> 40:11.800
The mascot

40:12.920 --> 40:14.650
and the blood-written poem...

40:16.360 --> 40:18.760
were that girl's scheme?

40:19.760 --> 40:21.710
You haven't been with our family

40:22.230 --> 40:23.880
for long,

40:24.550 --> 40:27.030
and I haven't had the chance to

40:27.400 --> 40:29.000
pass any wisdom down to you.

40:29.710 --> 40:32.590
Today, allow me to tell you

40:32.880 --> 40:34.670
about your father.

40:35.880 --> 40:37.150
Twenty years ago,

40:38.480 --> 40:39.480
Shu was

40:40.280 --> 40:42.800
just a petty official.

40:43.070 --> 40:44.670
He got to where he is today

40:46.360 --> 40:49.550
not by keeping the peace

40:49.550 --> 40:51.150
and always yielding,

40:52.000 --> 40:52.880
but by

40:53.400 --> 40:55.460
fighting his way through a situation

40:56.030 --> 40:58.630
with wolves at the front
and tigers at the back.

40:58.880 --> 41:00.740
He fought with tigers and snakes.

41:01.110 --> 41:03.070
He snatched food from wolves.

41:04.280 --> 41:08.150
He climbed the political ladder
the hard way,

41:08.590 --> 41:09.880
navigating a bloody

41:11.320 --> 41:12.720
and brutal competition.

41:26.840 --> 41:28.500
Sailing against the current,

41:29.400 --> 41:31.330
you fall back if you don't advance.

41:31.550 --> 41:33.750
Now that you're a part of the Xie family,

41:33.800 --> 41:38.260
you should know that we're different
from those centuries-old noble families.

41:38.280 --> 41:42.190
Our family fought hard
to get where we are today.

41:42.550 --> 41:43.760
The only way to

41:43.760 --> 41:45.320
eliminate disrespect

41:46.230 --> 41:47.400
is to fight back.
